  "local_changes": [
    "pyproject.toml: retain existing +urltrakb.5 release; exact runtime pins and Python >=3.10,<3.14; poetry-core==2.4.1",
    "Remove managed-service and legacy remote SDK transports, client selection, exports, cloud-specific errors and response status field",
    "Keep local parsing, storage and retrieval; reconcile stale TOC titles against evidenced body headings",
    "Remove cloud demos, notebooks and retired-API tests; retain and adapt local tests",
    "Replace upstream hosted-service README with local-source installation and use instructions",
    "Index title repair: prefer evidenced body headings over stale TOC titles; retain correction provenance and unresolved request failures",
    "Physical PDF readback: retain blank pages and printed labels; freeze managed parser inputs, relative assets and policy fingerprints; share validated full/range cache recovery; preserve Markdown default titles.",
    "Content blocks (#84): optional anchor policy through the shared content algorithm; preserve original summaries and PDF recursive AND predicate; portable frozen package parser registration, separate block ranges, verified cache/recovery mapping and assets.",
    "CSV locations (#85): generated column labels, padding and separators cannot anchor original sections; prefaces skip generated ranges.",
    "Physical slides (#89): portable PDF/notes snapshot; shared PDF content-based tree with explicit generated navigation anchors in body or notes; full/range cache recovery verifies both domains and physical ordinals.",
    "Reconcile the recorded patch hashes with the existing .5 snapshot; retain all current parser, frozen-input and slide readback fixes unchanged.",
    "Add packaged source identity for editable and wheel checks; package-only changes do not alter the content policy or request index rebuilding."
  ],
